      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-08_WidnesExaminer_art0009" n="art0009">
        <head>OUTFITTING</head>
        <p>OUTFITTING</p>
        <p>We do not confine our Bargain-giving to just a few things here and there. Take the Ladies Outfitting Department for instance. Not only the daintest of Lingerie but the most severely useful Winter Comforts in Woollen Underwear —the prettiest and most serviceable Dressing Gowns—are brought down in price according to our promise that EVERYTHING would be available at a lessened cost. But only by a personal look round can the FULL extent of the Bargain opportunity be accurately gauged.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-01-08_WidnesExaminer_art0010" n="art0010">
        <p>• • • • 14: I ( , t I • ••• • 4. , • • • • - •</p>
