        <p>A. cough may be dry and hard, or loose with 'much expectoration; it may be catarrhal with a 'dry tickling in ,the 'throat accompanied by partial stoppage of the nostrils and shortness of hreath. Veno's Lightning Cough Cure removes the cause of the cough, not smothering it but curing the diseased conditions which produce it. Leading British Analysis speak in the highest terras of Veno's Lightning Cough Cure, and un- failing reliability has won for it the largest sal of its class in the whole World. Veno's Light- ning Cough Cure not only radically cures the most stubboin coughs. but strengthens the lungs and gives perfect ease in breathing. Ask for Veno's Lightning Cough Cure, iprices 111 d., Is. 3d., and 3.5.. of all chemists.</p>
