        <p>THE PERSIA. Narrow Escape Of Mr. Harold Smith, M.P. It was stated in the "Daily Express "of Tues- day that Mr. Harold Smith, M.P., travelled by the P. and 0. liner Persia, carrying dispatches, but l'eft the vessel the day before she was tor- pedoed in the Mediterranean and over 180 of the passengers and crew lost their lives. Mr. Smith is serving as a lieutenant in the Royal Naval Volunteer Reserve, and has been engaged in carrying dispatches. It was on that duty that he left London. recently for the Mediterranean. I</p>
        <p>MENTIONED IN DISPATCHES.</p>
