        <p>The Cornish Riviera • FOR HEALTH AND RECREATION. THE CORNISH RIVIERA is the ideal Winter resort of the British Isles, where the climatic and scenic advan- tages, usually associated with foreign resorts, may be enjoyed to the full. It has a climate that is wonderfully mild and equable, and well favoured with health-giving sunshine, and possesses a coast scenery and countryside of marvellous beauty. Facilities are afforded for all kinds of recreation. , Full particulars of train services and farcs can be obtained from Stations or Offices, or from the Superintendent of the Line, Paddington Station, W. G.W.R. FRANK POTTER, General Manager.</p>
